usage: fetch_token_research_sources.py [-h] --output OUTPUT

Fetch primary sources and the pinned PAT CSVs into a NEW local research
directory. Requires pdftotext (Poppler) to extract PDFs. Does not execute
downloaded code. Full PDF/page/dataset copies are kept locally and ignored by
git.

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --output OUTPUT
